WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.285
Welcome to SkillPilot. Your learning, your
pace. First, you need a Claude account

2
00:00:05.285 --> 00:00:10.377
with an active Pro subscription. The
learning beta is for adults aged eighteen

3
00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:15.726
and over. We will set up the marketplace
together, then prepare your first learning

4
00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:17.091
session.

5
00:00:17.591 --> 00:00:24.573
In Claude, open your account menu, then
Settings and Plugins. Open Add and choose

6
00:00:24.573 --> 00:00:29.482
Add marketplace. Next, select Add from a
repository.

7
00:00:37.089 --> 00:00:42.204
Enter the repository address shown on
screen. You can also copy it from the

8
00:00:42.204 --> 00:00:47.664
guide below this video. Keep automatic
synchronisation switched on and select

9
00:00:47.664 --> 00:00:52.780
Sync. This lets Claude receive updates
from the SkillPilot marketplace.

10
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:59.399
The marketplace now shows SkillPilot Coach
version one. Open the plugin and select

11
00:00:59.399 --> 00:01:02.131
Add. Check that it is enabled.

12
00:01:08.749 --> 00:01:14.924
Open the plugin's Connectors tab and
select SkillPilot. Choose Connect. Once

13
00:01:14.924 --> 00:01:18.760
its status says Connected, Claude is
ready.

14
00:01:20.726 --> 00:01:27.231
Now open SkillPilot dot com and choose
Learn now. Read the notices and Terms of

15
00:01:27.231 --> 00:01:33.737
Use, and confirm them if you agree. The
website then guides you through setup.

16
00:01:37.552 --> 00:01:42.990
Create your SkillPilot ID. It is your
personal key to your learning progress. We

17
00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:47.812
keep it covered in this video. If you
already have an ID, use it again to

18
00:01:47.812 --> 00:01:50.923
continue with your existing progress.

19
00:01:51.423 --> 00:01:57.249
Save your ID as a protected file. Choose a
strong password and download the file.

20
00:01:57.249 --> 00:02:02.778
Keep both the file and your password safe
and private. They let you open your

21
00:02:02.778 --> 00:02:05.634
learning progress again later.

22
00:02:06.134 --> 00:02:11.702
Choose your curriculum, the framework for
your learning. Open University and Higher

23
00:02:11.702 --> 00:02:16.616
Education, then show all available
curricula. For this English example,

24
00:02:16.616 --> 00:02:21.857
choose MIT OpenCourseWare Foundations.
Pick the curriculum that fits your own

25
00:02:21.857 --> 00:02:23.625
learning plans.

26
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:29.521
Check your selected curriculum. This
example brings together mathematics and

27
00:02:29.521 --> 00:02:34.849
programming courses. Your learning
framework is now ready. Later, you can set

28
00:02:34.849 --> 00:02:39.296
your current focus, such as a particular
topic, in the cockpit.

29
00:02:39.796 --> 00:02:45.692
Choose Start with Claude. A new Claude
chat opens with a prepared message. Review

30
00:02:45.692 --> 00:02:51.514
it and send it as it is. Approve the first
tool request if prompted. Your coach can

31
00:02:51.514 --> 00:02:55.927
then load your learning context and get
started with you.

32
00:02:56.427 --> 00:03:01.942
Your cockpit shows your current learning
goal and saved progress. This fresh demo

33
00:03:01.942 --> 00:03:07.322
profile is just getting started. As you
learn, you can see what you have achieved

34
00:03:07.322 --> 00:03:09.998
and choose your next focus here.

35
00:03:10.498 --> 00:03:16.288
If an explanation feels unclear, ask your
coach for smaller steps or another

36
00:03:16.288 --> 00:03:22.387
example. Explain your own approach and ask
for a check. A hint can help you find the

37
00:03:22.387 --> 00:03:26.789
answer yourself. Tell your coach what
helps you learn.

38
00:03:27.289 --> 00:03:33.144
Your start message contains a private
learning session valid for twenty-four

39
00:03:33.144 --> 00:03:38.848
hours. Keep this message confidential.
After that, start a new session from

40
00:03:38.848 --> 00:03:44.780
SkillPilot. Your saved progress stays
accessible with the same SkillPilot ID.

41
00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:51.098
In the Claude app, continue learning in
the same chat, upload photos or use the

42
00:03:51.098 --> 00:03:57.146
camera. This is especially handy on your
phone. Voice mode works too. If the voice

43
00:03:57.146 --> 00:04:01.971
pauses, wait a moment. Claude will usually
carry on by itself.

44
00:04:02.471 --> 00:04:08.935
Claude processes your chat, photos and
voice. SkillPilot stores your learning

45
00:04:08.935 --> 00:04:15.567
progress. You can read all the steps below
this video. Now it is your turn. Discover

46
00:04:15.567 --> 00:04:19.602
what you can do, and celebrate every
success.
